    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): morale's pressure and recovery, and the blows on routers, in the crate (spec 39 step 7a) (#599)\n\nMorale (morale.rs): once a second, the pressure on a formation by the\nsides it fights on, one less for a flank a friend covers, or out of\ncontact its recovery by its units' condition and its leadership, up to\nits ceiling. FormationMorale.step hands the crate each squad's morale,\nleadership and ceiling and sets what it returns, with its band and\nevent. The blows on routers (rout_blows.rs): which router a hostile\nfront-rank fighter strikes from behind, its target and cooldown.\nRoutBlows hands over the routes and the fighters and makes the blows.\nThe ceiling, bands and shocks stay GDScript. The pressure and recovery\nscenarios are cargo tests now. Step 7 splits into 7a, 7b and 7c.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQ6rscKTaz6sQt8dq4Dypg\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
